        "id": 1165609
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-13T10:33:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My concern here that the charge_task in suspend (after a recent fix) only runs every minute.\nOne other way would be that if CMD_PWR is defined, then to reset the MAX_TIME to 500MS or so, and take the ~2mW hit that charge_task running that frequently does, and update the average that way. What do you think?",
      "parentUuid": "169273af_cbd211fd",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1445,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1445,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "5ea59932af2618665d724c566dd6abfb14b09b1c",
