        "id": 1001696
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-13T17:45:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can add a mutex if you want to make this completely reliable. You may find that some cros_ec console commands are not completely reliable, there is a lower bar for correctness than host commands, which must function correctly in all circumstances to not break production.",
